dialog 3 Bad selection for wrapping a sketch onto a face.|With the sketch to wrap active (Sketch -> In Workplane), in a workplane parallel to the face's axis, select one cylinder or cone of the solid (View -> Show -> Selectable Faces, to pick faces while sketching). The sketch's closed loops, text included, are rolled onto the side of the face towards the sketch and raised from it; the group's screen sets the height and whether they are raised or sunk.
